    <string name="status_troubleshooting_title">The engine isn\'t loaded</string>
    <string name="status_troubleshooting_1">1. Flash ResonanceFX-&lt;version&gt;.zip in Magisk, KernelSU or APatch and reboot.</string>
    <string name="status_troubleshooting_aidl">This ROM uses the AIDL audio-effect HAL. A module build without the AIDL engine cannot register here - check the module description after the next boot.</string>
    <string name="status_troubleshooting_2">2. In your root manager, tap the module\'s Action button: it re-patches, re-mounts and restarts audio, then reports what it found.</string>
    <string name="status_troubleshooting_3">3. Remove other audio-effect modules that install the same engine — the installer disables them, but leftovers in /vendor can conflict.</string>
    <string name="status_troubleshooting_4">4. Still failing? Copy the report above together with /data/adb/resonancefx/logs.</string>

